Third-party components and license notes
----------------------------------------

OpenSSL
    Used as a build and runtime dependency for cryptographic primitives
    (SHA-256, AES-128-CBC, HMAC-SHA256, RSA, X.509). This repository does
    not contain OpenSSL source code; the library is linked externally as
    provided by the OpenSSL project or by the target system.
    OpenSSL 3.x is licensed under the Apache License 2.0. OpenSSL 1.1.1
    and earlier are covered by the OpenSSL License and the original
    SSLeay license.

Linux MTD user-space interface definitions
    The <mtd/mtd-user.h> header (ioctl structures and constants) originates
    from the Linux kernel UAPI (GPL-2.0 WITH Linux-syscall-note) and is used
    at compile time only. No kernel or mtd-utils source code is included in
    this repository.

Monkfish Root CA certificate (files/ca.pem)
    A public X.509 root certificate distributed as trust material for
    device-server mutual authentication. It contains no private key.
